{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/14311","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/14311/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/14311/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/14311/events","html_url":"https://github.com/forem/forem/issues/14311","id":951529994,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU5NTE1Mjk5OTQ=","number":14311,"title":"Safari CSS gradient bug","user":{"login":"valtism","id":1286001,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODYwMDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1286001?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/valtism","html_url":"https://github.com/valtism","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valtism/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valtism/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valtism/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valtism/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valtism/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valtism/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valtism/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valtism/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valtism/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":480869965,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0ODA4Njk5NjU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"E99695","default":true,"description":"always open for contribution"},{"id":2174013257,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTc0MDEzMjU3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/labels/tech:%20frontend","name":"tech: frontend","color":"175067","default":false,"description":"changes will primarily involve frontend technologies"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2021-07-23T12:18:38Z","updated_at":"2021-10-13T21:38:55Z","closed_at":"2021-10-13T21:38:55Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\n\r\nIn comment breakouts on posts, the comments are partially shown, with a gradient fade at the end. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"636\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2021-07-23 at 10 10 13 pm\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1286001/126780059-bc8d3b60-cb18-495a-a700-9c38bea60a20.png\">\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, there is a bug in Safari (https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=150940) that causes this fade to go through grey when one of the stops is transparent.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n\r\nThis is how the gradient should look like:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"617\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2021-07-23 at 10 10 03 pm\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1286001/126780187-07da9c42-2df8-46d8-9fb6-ea509b351f6e.png\">\r\n\r\nFortunately, there is a workaround for this in Safari (this screenshot is in safari). The trick is to fade to an rgba of the same colour, with 0 alpha.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"365\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2021-07-23 at 10 09 56 pm\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1286001/126780317-a141afe4-38cf-428b-9b94-596ca9452968.png\">\r\n\r\nThis is even doable using the existing CSS variable provided it gets converted from hex, which it is currently, to rgb. If it is rgb, it can be set like this: `rgba(var(--story-comments-bg), 0)`\r\n\r\n- OS, version: MacOS\r\n- Browser, version: Safari 15.0","closed_by":{"login":"nickytonline","id":833231,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMzIzMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/833231?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickytonline","html_url":"https://github.com/nickytonline","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickytonline/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickytonline/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickytonline/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickytonline/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickytonline/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickytonline/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickytonline/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickytonline/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickytonline/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/14311/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/14311/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}